    {
      "text": "I will try them for thee, Judg. 7:4. God left him, to try him, 2 Chr. 32:31. when he hath tried me, I shall come forth as gold, Job 23:10. thou hast tried us, as silver is tried, Ps. 66:10. try me, and know my thoughts, Ps. 139:23. Lord trieth the hearts, Prov. 17:3. I will melt them, and try them, Jer. 9:7. to try them, and to purge, Dan. 11:35. Many … made white, and tried, Dan. 12:10. I … will try them as gold is tried, Zech. 13:9.",
